# Local mkcert development certificates (one of the pair is a private key).
# Copy them in to serve the viewer over HTTPS on the LAN. A phone needs a secure
# context or `navigator.gpu` is undefined and the viewer silently falls back to
# WebGL2. See the `server.https` block in vite.config.ts.
*.pem
